#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/vcs_versioning.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>vcs_versioning</application> provides essential functionality "
"for setuptools_scm that allows that module to properly set version control "
"metadata."
